:: Inventory {"position":"1425,125","size":"100,100"}
<div class="inventory-panel">
(if: $gateKey is 1)[🗝️ Key to the North Gate<br>]
(if: $ravenCharm is 1)[🐦 The Raven Charm<br>]
(if: $smallDagger is 1)[🗡️ Shepherd's Dagger (30-50 dam)<br>]
(if: $stoneAxe is 1)[🪓 <span class="glow-text">Stonebreaker Axe (50-70 dam)</span>)<br>]
(if: $healthPotions > 0)[🧪 You have (text-color: red)[Health Potions] x(print: $healthPotions). (link: "Use")[
  (set: $healthPotions to $healthPotions - 1)
  (set: $playerHp to (min: $playerMaxHp, $playerHp + 30))
  (goto: (history:)'s last)
]]<br>
(else:)[🧪 No Health Potions remaining.]<br>
(if: $boarTusk is 1)[🦷 Boar Tusk<br>]
(if: $northRing is 1)[💍 Ring of the North Watch<br>]
</div>
(link: "Close")[(goto: (history:)'s last)]
<audio autoplay>
  <source src="audio/inventory.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
</audio>


:: Journal {"position":"1325,0","size":"100,100"}
<div class="journal-panel">
(if: $clueInnGreet is 1)[📝 Pass the greetings to the Market Merchant.<br>]
(if: $clueChapel is 1)[📝 Go to the Alley and find The Chapel.<br>]
(if: $clueRowan is 1)[📝 You received a blessing, now go and find the Keymaster.<br>]
(if: $stoneMarkers is 1)[📝 Search for Stone Markers upstream.<br>]
(if: $clueWatchtower is 1)[📝 Find the Old Watchtower.<br>]
(if: $clueBoarTusk is 1)[📝 Kill a wild boar and get it's tusk.<br>]
(if: $clueAxe is 1)[📝 Miller hid a powerful weapon in the Old Mill. You should find it before continuing to Northern Foothills..<br>]
(if: $clueRangerLog is 1)[📝 Reach out the Highridge Outpost in Northern Foothills.<br>]

</div>
(link: "Close")[(goto: (history:)'s last)]
<audio autoplay>
